    "notes": "Inventory read from site/data/sidebar.yml at v5.3.8 (the docs site's own page index); docs URLs derived by the same title slugification the site uses. Canonical taxonomy mapping is an explicit table in the extractor. The Button demo loads Bootstrap's published bootstrap.min.css from jsDelivr at the same pinned version with its published SRI hash — a version-pinned URL, not a live fetch. The demo switches color mode via Bootstrap's own data-bs-theme root attribute, which that same stylesheet defines: an explicit ?mode= in its URL is applied once as a standalone override, otherwise it mirrors the embedding parent document's <html class=\"dark\"> live through a MutationObserver."
